{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WpList0QghYx0-tMN5WBRA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.565929+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WpList0QghYx0-tMN5WBRA","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadGcHegc7t1oCcnW18WtpxpWlM6KT50hOfzemwRf3EW1GGcsYibLjibaUbmzCjv959CZ0k99Q966jnFKnHerS4J9GErTQic7dXj3mKyPicslVbw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0D9eNPzjZTWZyO9nglxp6ezPR0d9tZJJpVM3OBwqbgm0kRLJiaEwjE0ibHeZBk2g4LjEhgCM0ibhu5Ag0f7POqV7qktIe2cR39go/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t1nLYtXZDiblJFo1K4VWbqtOl6AKtK8PERMN4yXZ2xpCIQkzF3fRv4h2aucOnJJ3DOJGwHnL1uLgfMiaxIj7GBwTZyVBYXZjCcSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>南京理工大学计算机科学与工程学院（人工智能学院、软件学院）</span></span></strong><span>溯源1953年哈军工模拟计算机研究组，是国内较早设立计算机相关学科的院系，2018年、2024 年分别增设人工智能学院、软件学院合署办学，2025年获批江苏省人工智能学院、江苏省工业软件学院。学院坐落钟山校区，深耕国防特色智能信息领域，学科实力顶尖：计算机科学为ESI全球前1‰学科，2025-2026年US.News人工智能全球17位、计算机科学全球56位，拥有“模式识别与智能系统”国家重点二级学科及博士点，“计算机科学与技术”“软件工程”“智能科学与技术”</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>个一级学科博士点及</span><strong><em><span><span>3</span></span></em></strong><span>个国家一流本科专业。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2oWe8diciaLg8Lib9BrGZNbtG23o5XkkLWftefkd90SrdFiaCzdAI183LfeztVsic4hksx8xk3mKlfo7UaL0PgQic3nXvm2QUKrclsE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院师资</span><strong><em><span><span>192</span></span></em></strong><span>人，博导</span><strong><em><span><span>53</span></span></em></strong><span>人，集聚国家级领军、青年人才数</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>人，搭建教育部、工信部、全国重点实验室等</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>余家国省部级科研平台，与华为、百度、中航科技等共建产学研基地。近十年承担国家重点研发、科技创新2030等百项重大课题，斩获</span><strong><em><span><span>2</span></span></em></strong><span>项国家自然科学二等奖、数</span><strong><em><span><span>10</span></span></em></strong><span>项省部级一等奖，科研成果落地高铁智能检测、公共安全、车载智能座舱等场景。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3bd00icnoziceAjE1hLWq6RuwhDScjrlWzbMBibjGx9SOTOjNZHfmaSwBhThAhaPq1oHOchdfvThn8wPuQ5trScR5X045fQyXJm4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院学术氛围浓厚，教风学风严谨，以共振-共创-共荣为理念，坚持国防特色高层次人才自主培养，注重理论联系实际，人才培养成果显著。研究生斩获CVPR、ICCV、阿里巴巴天池大赛等国际国内算法赛事冠军</span><strong><em><span><span>30</span></span></em></strong><span>余项，多名博士获评福布斯30U30精英、学会优秀博士论文等荣誉。毕业生就业率常年</span><strong><em><span><span>100%</span></span></em></strong><span>，2026届研究生平均月薪</span><span><em><strong><span>3</span></strong></em></span><span>万元以上，大批学子入职军工央企、头部互联网、信创龙头企业，发展前景广阔，热忱欢迎全国优秀本科生走进南理工计算机学院。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3rETGL60x8PX6pNV7HVqu56zoPibeYWtBwQr2NiawKToEN7ASRFt7wlKv4ibkxNiaxjt3IhcAxIkwanrk1tFLdIaHDopQYoNNL5Ps/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t3UbhoW5ia9POUAScoOEjygLLFwKZZepX3ZskIScKicjdwmHK05ORgx01XABqJqjQOh3ZH7kbJuFlicEJngLystkKd92oBEWbqaCM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t0ib5U8JgWPEvuOou1gCXia54lBytpe7VfZbLo8fkuuiaiaqScU0gZibXNTyxrr7XeHTtZiaRhlYmUbcic8F40GeOUgo9t2ib7hHyMdnAE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2s5ULBs8d2INoQF1yvEbqM7SRQLG62themASib1TxDMwgIdRnffvTMz0NxkAXwHLg95U33B3I3hlHbHpc8qJCXXPUOoDLPKGFg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t08K8Mf0EMD5U9oiaSeaMiaGgFD4ibPzcMPVQ4fJ1CpMibRb3ibIAKCLopt7rOYyXiahmFXKia8krPL5jyhAHeYtTlU6uHpnugDGK70hA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>100人左右</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月5日-7月30日（不在时间范围内的申请无效）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人为2027届全日制本科应届在校生，本科综合成绩优异，专业排名靠前，英语水平良好（提供含专业排名及绩点的成绩单、四六级/雅思/托福等英语成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科专业为计算机类、人工智能、软件工程、电子信息、自动化、数学等计算机相关及相近专业，具备扎实专业基础，拥有科创、算法竞赛、科研项目经历者优先；</span></p><p><span>（3）热爱计算机、人工智能、软件领域科研，具备较强逻辑思维、自主学习与科研创新能力，有志于攻读硕士研究生；</span></p><p><span>（4）思想品德端正，政治素质良好，遵纪守法、身心健康，在校期间无违纪处分记录。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过邮件方式进行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>所有材料合并生成单个PDF文件，命名为“本科院校-姓名-专业“，同样主题发送至邮箱lijingxiong@njust.edu.cn：</span></span></p><p><span>1.校园开放日报名申请表（系统导出打印签字扫描）；</span></p><p><span>2.本科前5学期完整成绩单（含专业排名及绩点，加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>3.英语等级证书扫描件（四六级/雅思/托福等）；</span></p><p><span>4.加分佐证材料：竞赛获奖证书、科研论文、专利、项目证明、荣誉证书等（如有）；</span></p><p><span>5.个人陈述（1000字以内，介绍科研兴趣、读研规划）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>一、开幕式（8.16）</span></p><p><span>二、课程教学：人工智能基础与进阶 （8.16-8.17）</span></p><p><span>三、课程教学:数据科学与AI的数学基础（8.18-8.19）</span></p><p><span>四、专题讲座：生成式AI高阶应用（8.20-8.21）</span></p><p><span>五、研究生学术交流模块与闭幕式 （8.22）</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7.</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>李老师</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子邮箱</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>lijingxiong@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2QAuDELxjrNLtaremqeYE7xlT5kc7Hj5JSAlKAjjCibSXQYytEbRWHpy3mpVFoT8jV9libr1c6jv84oBSqRVlPkMZ6rCZos9eXI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 计算机科学与工程学院（人工智能学院、软件学院）</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 吴雅琪</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 计算机科学与工程学院（人工智能学院、软件学院）</span></p><p><span>审核 | 于雷</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iadGcHegc7t2GkaFiauDmYzhDDJZQ4IicKu0aozVXvxaldlIVgpxnDVOwfmbnXUZ2UqgYjUoKXIndhpLYxQicbGxqQNBMeAviavvhc5Hu7ZAoxr4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"540ecc8a65723f8466b517cb14e65e44c018d4a988b8a06e54ce722f9c1a8a47","textLength":1530,"sourceSha256":"4aa9ddc2325ce1a5f7e89556637acf0f3150a03f7029734a97314557216e2bfa","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9a9128d8175d7326d843","title":"2026年南京理工大学计算机科学与工程学院（人工智能学院、软件学院）2026年全国“优秀大学生”校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:26.565929+00:00"}
